id: poisoned
name: Poisoned
kind: condition
description: >
  Poison flows through your veins, reducing your ability to fight and sapping
  away your health.
text: >
  At the end of each of your turns, lose Life Points equal to 1/10 of your
  Maximum Life Points. Additionally, double any Health Threshold Penalties you
  suffer from.

---

[passive]
threshold.penalty *= 2;

[automatic/end-of-turn]
life.value -= floor(life.max / 10);
